Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.492 --> 00:00:20.233
Today we learn: Comparing Things. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.907 --> 00:00:24.724
Similar. Say it with me. Similar!

6
00:00:28.306 --> 00:00:32.056
Different. Say it with me. Different!

7
00:00:35.472 --> 00:00:38.838
Better. Say it with me. Better!

8
00:00:42.359 --> 00:00:45.942
Cheaper. Say it with me. Cheaper!

9
00:00:49.446 --> 00:00:53.230
Faster. Say it with me. Faster!

10
00:00:56.776 --> 00:01:00.743
Quality. Say it with me. Quality!

11
00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:07.996
Prefer. Say it with me. Prefer!

12
00:01:11.499 --> 00:01:15.382
Compare. Say it with me. Compare!

13
00:01:18.888 --> 00:01:22.521
Value. Say it with me. Value!

14
00:01:26.049 --> 00:01:29.999
Expensive. Say it with me. Expensive!

15
00:01:33.465 --> 00:01:44.067
Grammar time! Comparatives and superlatives. Listen. This one is cheaper. That one is the fastest.

16
00:01:44.117 --> 00:01:50.723
Your turn. Say it with me. This one is cheaper. That one is the fastest.

17
00:01:55.948 --> 00:02:05.168
This phone is similar to that one, but it is cheaper and faster. I prefer the better quality, even if I compare prices first.

18
00:02:05.218 --> 00:02:06.821
I like this story!

19
00:02:07.824 --> 00:02:13.140
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.340
Better!

21
00:02:15.171 --> 00:02:20.426
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:20.476 --> 00:02:21.626
Prefer!

23
00:02:22.503 --> 00:02:31.319
Think and answer. Compare two things you use every day.

24
00:02:31.369 --> 00:02:32.737
Great answer!

25
00:02:33.802 --> 00:02:38.177
